## Lane warm-up manifest (Software Development dispatch)

Normative field semantics: [`.sedea/centers/sedea/docs/lane-manifest-contract.md`](.sedea/centers/sedea/docs/lane-manifest-contract.md). R&D authoring notes: [`.sedea/centers/software-development/docs/development-process.md`](../docs/development-process.md) § *Lane warm-up manifest contract*. Spawn/reload bindings: [`.sedea/centers/sedea/rules/4_mission.mdc`](.sedea/centers/sedea/rules/4_mission.mdc) § *Lane warm-up manifest (spawn and reload)*.

